Suppress GCC 14 false-positive diagnostics in npu_compiler sources.
Each pragma is file-scoped and targets only the specific warning triggered
by that translation unit.

--- a/src/vpux_compiler/src/dialect/ELF/transforms/passes/update_elf_section_flags.cpp
